graph TD
    U[User browser] --> FE[Next.js frontend]
    FE --> API[FastAPI signaling server]
    API --> LK[LiveKit SFU]
    LK --> TA[TransportAgent]
    TA -->|audio.inbound raw PCM| NATS[NATS JetStream]
    NATS --> STT[Rust stt-agent]
    STT -->|audio.perception partials| NATS
    STT -->|chat.input final transcript| NATS
    NATS --> BA[BrainAgent]
    BA --> CS[CognitiveService and CognitivePipeline]
    CS --> PG[(Postgres or SQLite fallback)]
    CS --> NEO[(Neo4j)]
    CS --> Ollama[Ollama]
    BA -->|chat.output chunks| NATS
    NATS --> VA[Rust voice-agent]
    VA --> SOVITS[GPT-SoVITS API]
    VA -->|audio.stream raw PCM| NATS
    NATS --> TA
    TA --> LK
    LK --> FE
    SA[SurfacingAgent] -->|memory.surfaced| NATS
    SYS[SystemAgent] -->|system.tick| NATS
    SUB[SubconsciousAgent] -->|internal chat.input| NATS
    VIS[VisionAgent] -->|vision.description| NATS
